256
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,720
It's your last chance.

257
00:18:57,220 --> 00:18:59,340
I refuse to bid you farewell.

258
00:18:59,780 --> 00:19:02,417
Stay in good health wherever
your path takes you.

259
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:04,020
I will see you again.

260
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:05,460
I swear it.

261
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:14,337
I already told you I don't care.

262
00:19:14,420 --> 00:19:17,140
Now stop prattling and become a horse!

263
