Listen to me, Lene.

264
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:22,337
You are the servant of Claire Francois.

265
00:19:22,420 --> 00:19:25,017
Which makes you the highest
ranked commoner in this kingdom.

266
00:19:25,100 --> 00:19:27,580
Don't let anyone treat you like that.

267
00:19:29,620 --> 00:19:31,557
Lene, you'll never believe this.

268
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:35,600
I met the most wonderful,
handsome, charming prince. Lene!

269
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:37,000
Lene?

270
00:19:37,620 --> 00:19:38,660
Lene?

271
00:19:40,060 --> 00:19:41,100
Lene?

272
00:19:54,500 --> 00:19:57,040
She was a good master to you.

273
00:19:57,420 --> 00:19:58,900
Don't say was.

274
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:00,420
It's not over.

275
00:20:01,560 --> 00:20:03,300
Whatever happens.

276
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:06,030
Ms.

277
