Hey, Ms. Clare.

280
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:23,320
What is it?

281
00:20:23,840 --> 00:20:25,781
I'm here if you need a hug, okay?

282
00:20:27,660 --> 00:20:30,360
What a ridiculous suggestion. Let's go.

283
00:20:38,460 --> 00:20:40,284
What do you think you're doing?

284
00:20:40,460 --> 00:20:43,140
I will slap you, you impetuous creature!

285
00:20:43,500 --> 00:20:45,540
Don't be afraid to cry. What?

286
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:46,700
Why would I cry?

287
00:20:46,940 --> 00:20:50,352
I am not so frail the loss of
one servant would make me...

288
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:52,510
Go ahead.

289
00:20:52,593 --> 00:20:55,457
I can't see your face when
I'm holding you like this.

290
00:20:55,540 --> 00:20:56,777
I told you...

291
00:20:56,860 --> 00:20:59,720
You wanted her to stay, didn't you?

292
00:21:12,040 --> 00:21:13,000
I know.

293
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:15,780
This world can be so unfair.

294
00:21:16,260 --> 00:21:19,378
Sometimes we can't even stay
with the people we love.

295
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:34,588
You're incredibly audacious for
a commoner, you realize that.

296
00:21:34,780 --> 00:21:38,309
Yup, guess this means you're
going to punish me for it, huh?

297
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:39,842
Absolutely not.

298
00:21:40,260 --> 00:21:42,789
You would only consider
it a reward anyway.

299
00:21:44,300 --> 00:21:47,737
You've got me all figured out,
you scrunchies, naked chuse of me.

300
00:21:47,820 --> 00:21:49,557
All that's enough now is
for us to get married.

301
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:50,934
That is not happening.

302
00:21:52,020 --> 00:21:53,400
Aw, why not?

303
00:21:53,780 --> 00:21:54,940
I'd be a fun wife.

304
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:01,360
I hope we see her again.

305
00:22:02,080 --> 00:22:03,980
I'm certain we will, someday.

306
00:22:04,780 --> 00:22:10,920
Thank you.

307
00:22:34,880 --> 00:22:38,180
It's not so happy What is it?

308
00:22:38,520 --> 00:22:39,700
How do you feel?

309
00:22:40,940 --> 00:22:41,770
I don't understand.

310
00:22:41,853 --> 00:22:42,683
I don't care.

311
00:22:42,766 --> 00:22:43,596
I don't care.

312
00:22:43,679 --> 00:22:44,737
I don't care.

313
00:22:44,820 --> 00:22:46,597
I don't care. I don't care.

314
00:22:46,680 --> 00:22:48,637
I don't care.

315
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:50,297
I don't care.

316
00:22:50,380 --> 00:22:54,060
Make money, yes, were you, the match one?

317
00:22:54,940 --> 00:22:57,780
It's too late, so I'm crazy.

318
00:22:58,340 --> 00:23:00,437
I don't wanna be a lie.

319
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:02,577
Thank no words with the expression?

320
00:23:02,660 --> 00:23:05,257
Let me spread, it's never a lie.

321
00:23:05,340 --> 00:23:06,897
I'm going to give it a lie.

322
00:23:06,980 --> 00:23:08,877
Lead the words together.

323
00:23:08,960 --> 00:23:09,790
I love it, I love it, so, let's play!

324
00:23:09,873 --> 00:23:14,237
I'm not too late, I am too late.

325
00:23:14,320 --> 00:23:17,220
It's not a lie.

326
00:23:25,980 --> 00:23:27,960
Thank you.

327
00:23:47,600 --> 00:23:49,177
Hey, did you hear the news?

328
00:23:49,260 --> 00:23:50,090
She's coming.

329
00:23:50,220 --> 00:23:52,620
Yes, and it was decided quite suddenly.

330
00:23:52,940 --> 00:23:54,837
Claire's been pretty down as of late.

331
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:56,777
Maybe this will help
cheer her up a little.

332
00:23:56,860 --> 00:23:57,690
Oh?

333
00:23:57,773 --> 00:23:58,603
